<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela 96 tax collection nearly 10 pct of GDP.</title>
<headline>Venezuela 96 tax collection nearly 10 pct of GDP.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan tax collection in 1996 will reach 2.2 trillion bolivars ($4.68 billion) or nearly 10 precent of Gross Domestic Product, president of Venezuela's tax superintendency Seniat, Edgar Paredes Pisani, said.</p>
<p>&quot;That exceeds both our and the International Monetary Fund's expectations,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
